WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.726
Go to Orders, and click Order summary.

00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:07.091
It shows each part's quantities, for every day with a John Deere file.

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:10.700
Choose the days, for example Last 7 days.

00:00:11.151 --> 00:00:13.968
Each day has Firm, Addition, and Forecast.

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:18.193
Addition is green when Firm went up, and red when it went down.

00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:23.291
To see only some dates side by side, choose Compare dates, under Show.

00:00:23.741 --> 00:00:26.539
Click Export to download it as an Excel file.
